// title: Visualize the Sysinternal tool usage of the last 30 days · Sentinel
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceProcessEvents, Usage
// purpose: Visualize the Sysinternal tool usage of the last 30 days · Sentinel
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/Defender%20For%20Endpoint/Visualizations/Visualization%20-%20SysinternalToolUsage.md
